[{"answer":"\"Ring, ring.\" The phone is ringing.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/135-first-date-2019-04-07-04-24-13/1.mp3"},{"answer":"My mother answers it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/135-first-date-2019-04-07-04-24-13/2.mp3"},{"answer":"\"Hello,\" she says. It is for me.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/135-first-date-2019-04-07-04-24-13/3.mp3"},{"answer":"When I pick up the phone, I hear a boy's voice.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/135-first-date-2019-04-07-04-24-13/4.mp3"},{"answer":"It is a boy I go to school with.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/135-first-date-2019-04-07-04-24-13/5.mp3"},{"answer":"This boy is very nice, and he is cute, too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/135-first-date-2019-04-07-04-24-13/6.mp3"},{"answer":"He asks me if I want to go out for dinner with him tonight.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/135-first-date-2019-04-07-04-24-13/7.mp3"},{"answer":"I say yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/135-first-date-2019-04-07-04-24-13/8.mp3"},{"answer":"He's going to pick me up at 5:30 p.m. in the evening.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/135-first-date-2019-04-07-04-24-13/9.mp3"},{"answer":"He has a nice red car.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/135-first-date-2019-04-07-04-24-13/10.mp3"},{"answer":"Before he picks me up, I have to find an outfit to wear.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/135-first-date-2019-04-07-04-24-13/11.mp3"},{"answer":"I am nervous and don't know what to wear.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/135-first-date-2019-04-07-04-24-13/12.mp3"},{"answer":"So my sister picks out an outfit for me.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/135-first-date-2019-04-07-04-24-13/13.mp3"},{"answer":"I feel excited and have the sensation of butterflies in my stomach.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/135-first-date-2019-04-07-04-24-13/14.mp3"},{"answer":"The inside of my hands are damp, too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/135-first-date-2019-04-07-04-24-13/15.mp3"},{"answer":"I put on my outfit and do my hair.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/135-first-date-2019-04-07-04-24-13/16.mp3"},{"answer":"My sister gives me some nice clips to put in my hair.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/135-first-date-2019-04-07-04-24-13/17.mp3"},{"answer":"\"Ding dong,\" the doorbell buzzes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/135-first-date-2019-04-07-04-24-13/18.mp3"},{"answer":"My date is here!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/135-first-date-2019-04-07-04-24-13/19.mp3"},{"answer":"I hurry to the door, so I can greet him.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/135-first-date-2019-04-07-04-24-13/20.mp3"},{"answer":"He tells me that I look nice","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/135-first-date-2019-04-07-04-24-13/21.mp3"},{"answer":"and that we are going to a place called M-T Bellies.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/135-first-date-2019-04-07-04-24-13/22.mp3"},{"answer":"When we arrive at M-T Bellies,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/135-first-date-2019-04-07-04-24-13/23.mp3"},{"answer":"there is loud music playing.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/135-first-date-2019-04-07-04-24-13/24.mp3"},{"answer":"A smiling waitress comes who serves us our food.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/135-first-date-2019-04-07-04-24-13/25.mp3"},{"answer":"I order a large caesar salad.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/135-first-date-2019-04-07-04-24-13/26.mp3"},{"answer":"My date orders steak.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/135-first-date-2019-04-07-04-24-13/27.mp3"},{"answer":"When it arrives, the food looks and is delicious!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/135-first-date-2019-04-07-04-24-13/28.mp3"},{"answer":"The waitress asks us if we want dessert after we've finished.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/135-first-date-2019-04-07-04-24-13/29.mp3"},{"answer":"But we are too full.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/135-first-date-2019-04-07-04-24-13/30.mp3"},{"answer":"So we ask for our bill to pay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/135-first-date-2019-04-07-04-24-13/31.mp3"},{"answer":"My date pays for the meal.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/135-first-date-2019-04-07-04-24-13/32.mp3"},{"answer":"I brought money just in case we would share the cost.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/135-first-date-2019-04-07-04-24-13/33.mp3"},{"answer":"When we leave the restaurant, we go for a walk by the river.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/135-first-date-2019-04-07-04-24-13/34.mp3"},{"answer":"It is a beautiful night.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/135-first-date-2019-04-07-04-24-13/35.mp3"},{"answer":"I am enjoying my first date.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/135-first-date-2019-04-07-04-24-13/36.mp3"},{"answer":"I am laughing and having fun.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/135-first-date-2019-04-07-04-24-13/37.mp3"},{"answer":"It is time for us to go home.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/135-first-date-2019-04-07-04-24-13/38.mp3"},{"answer":"So my date takes me home.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/135-first-date-2019-04-07-04-24-13/39.mp3"},{"answer":"I smile and thank him for the great time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/135-first-date-2019-04-07-04-24-13/40.mp3"},{"answer":"I hope he'll ask me out again!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/135-first-date-2019-04-07-04-24-13/41.mp3"}]
